        "definition": {
          "type": "definition",
          "settings": {
            "term": "The name",
            "meaning": "EvlveX is derived from the word <strong>Evolution</strong> — the idea of constantly growing, changing and becoming a better version of yourself."
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We believe confidence comes from embracing who you are, owning your journey and having the courage to evolve in your own way. It’s not about being perfect or becoming someone else; it’s about discovering your potential and being comfortable in your own identity.</p><p>At EvlveX, we create footwear for individuals who believe in moving forward, expressing themselves and walking their own path with confidence.</p>",
            "size": "lead"
          }
        }
      },
